### 2.3 Espaciados

Usar la escala por defecto de Tailwind: `0.25rem` steps (p. ej. `p-4` = `1rem`, `gap-2` = `0.5rem`, `mb-6` = `1.5rem`).

| Clase | Valor |
|---|---|
| `p-3` | `0.75rem` |
| `p-4` | `1rem` |
| `p-6` | `1.5rem` |
| `px-3` | `0.75rem` horizontal |
| `px-4` | `1rem` horizontal |
| `px-6` | `1.5rem` horizontal |
| `py-2` | `0.5rem` vertical |
| `py-2.5` | `0.625rem` vertical |
| `py-3` | `0.75rem` vertical |
| `gap-1` | `0.25rem` |
| `gap-1.5` | `0.375rem` |
| `gap-2` | `0.5rem` |
| `gap-3` | `0.75rem` |
| `gap-4` | `1rem` |
| `gap-6` | `1.5rem` |
| `spacing-113` | `28.25rem` (custom) |

### 2.4 Bordes

| Clase | Valor | Uso |
|---|---|---|
| `rounded` | `0.25rem` | General |
| `rounded-md` | `0.375rem` | Botones pequeños |
| `rounded-lg` | `0.5rem` | Cards, inputs, modales |
| `rounded-xl` | `0.75rem` | Cards principales, badges, callouts |
| `rounded-full` | `9999px` | Avatares, badges redondos, iconos |
| `border` | `1px solid` | Bordes estándar |
| `border-2` | `2px solid` | Focus rings, bordes destacados |
| `border-gray-100` | — | Cards, contenedores |
| `border-gray-200` | — | Bordes estándar |
| `border-gray-300` | — | Inputs, botones outline |
| `border-muni-primary/20` | — | Items destacados |

### 2.5 Sombras

| Clase | Uso |
|---|---|
| `shadow-sm` | Cards, contenedores elevados |
| `shadow-md` | Hover de cards, dropdowns |
| `shadow-lg` | Modales, menús flotantes |

### 2.6 Breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Valor |
|---|---|
| `xs` | `475px` |
| `sm` | `640px` |
| `md` | `768px` |
| `lg` | `1024px` |
| `xl` | `1280px` |
| `2xl` | `1536px` |
| `3xl` | `120rem` (custom) |

### 2.7 Animaciones

| Clase | Animación |
|---|---|
| `animate-fadeIn` | `fadeIn 0.3s ease-in-out` (opacity 0→1 + translateY 10px→0) |
| `animate-scaleIn` | `scaleIn 0.2s ease-out` (opacity 0→1 + scale 0.95→1) |
| `animate-pulse` | `pulse 2s cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.6,1) infinite` |

> Preferir `framer-motion` para animaciones declarativas en React, usando `motion.div` con `initial`, `animate`, `exit`.

