## 3. Clases Utilitarias y Patrones Predilectos

### 3.1 Layouts Comunes

#### Page Layout

```tsx
<div className="container mx-auto inner-padding">
  <div className="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-4">
    <aside className="lg:col-span-1 space-y-6 lg:sticky lg:top-50">{/* sidebar */}</aside>
    <div className="lg:col-span-3">{/* main content */}</div>
  </div>
</div>
```

#### Flexbox

```tsx
<div className="flex items-center gap-2">
<div className="flex items-start gap-3">
<div className="flex items-center justify-between">
<div className="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
<div className="flex flex-col gap-4">
```

#### Grids

```tsx
<div className="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
<div className="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-4"><!-- sidebar layout --></div>
```

#### Contenedor principal

```tsx
<div className="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
```

#### Secciones con padding

```tsx
<section className="section-padding bg-white dark:bg-gray-950">
```

### 3.2 Cards

| Clase/Patrón | Descripción |
|---|---|
| `card` | Contenedor base: `rounded-xl border dark:bg-gray-900 border-gray-100 shadow-sm hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all ease-in-out` |
| `card-titulo` | Título con hover effect: `text-lg font-semibold leading-tight mb-3 text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 group-hover/card:text-muni-primary hover:underline hover:text-muni-primary` |
| `card-importante` | Card de alerta: `p-6 border bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-700/10 rounded-xl border-amber-200` |
| `card-importante-header` | Header de card importante: `flex items-start gap-3 mb-4` |
| `card-selected` | Estado seleccionado: `border-muni-primary/30! bg-white! dark:bg-gray-900! shadow-sm! text-muni-primary!` |
| `detalles-card-items-bg` | Item dentro de card: `flex items-center gap-3 p-3 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg bg-gray-50/80 dark:bg-gray-950/40` |

