| `btn-gris` | Secundario outline: `inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-md border border-gray-300 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900! dark:text-gray-300 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-muni-primary` |
| `btn-gris-xl` | Gris grande: `inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 border border-gray-300 rounded-lg dark:text-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-900` |
