| Clase | Uso |
|---|---|
| `search-input` | Input de búsqueda: `block w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 py-2.5 pl-10 pr-3 text-sm text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-200 placeholder-gray-500 focus:border-muni-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-muni-primary/20` |
| `search-filter` | Select de filtro: `block w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-white dark:bg-gray-700! py-2.5 pl-3 pr-8 text-sm focus:border-muni-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-muni-primary/20` |
| `input-modal` | Input modal: `block w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-300 bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-900! py-2.5 px-3 placeholder-gray-400 focus:bg-white focus:ring-1 focus:ring-muni-primary focus:border-muni-primary` |
| `custom-select` | Select sin flecha nativa: `appearance-none` |

### 3.6 Accesibilidad (patrón obligatorio)

Todos los elementos interactivos deben llevar:

```tsx
focus:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-muni-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2
```

Además:
- `sr-only` para contenido solo para lectores de pantalla.
- `visually-hidden` como alternativa absoluta.
- `prefers-reduced-motion` y `motion-safe:` / `motion-reduce:` para animaciones.
- Etiquetas `aria-label` o `aria-labelledby` en todo elemento interactivo sin texto visible.

### 3.7 Estados Hover / Active / Focus

| Elemento | Hover | Focus | Active |
|---|---|---|---|
| Botón primario | `hover:bg-muni-primary-700` | `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-muni-primary focus-visible:ring-offset-2` | — |
| Botón outline | `hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-700` | idem | — |
| Card | `hover:border-gray-200 hover:shadow-md` | — | — |
| Enlace | `hover:underline hover:text-muni-primary` | idem | — |
| Input | — | `focus:border-muni-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-muni-primary/20 focus:outline-none` | — |
| Modal trigger | — | — | `active:scale-98` |

### 3.8 Iconos

- Usar **`lucide-react`** como librería de iconos.
- Tamaños estándar: `size={4}` (equivalente a `w-4 h-4`), `size={5}`, `size={3.5}`.
- Íconos decorativos → `aria-hidden="true"`.

